      "description": "<p>Family post emotional statements to Instagram a month after their son and brother died at a rehab facility</p><p>Cindy Crawford and Rande Gerber have said they are “beyond heartbroken” in a tribute to their “sweet beautiful” son, Presley.</p><p>Their eldest child <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/lifeandstyle/2026/sep/21/presley-gerber-son-of-cindy-crawford-dead-aged-27\">died aged 27</a> at a rehab facility on 20 September, according to Los Angeles county medical examiner records. The cause of his death has not been disclosed.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/lifeandstyle/2026/oct/19/we-are-beyond-heartbroken-cindy-crawford-rande-and-kaia-gerber-share-tributes-to-presley\">Continue reading...</a>",
